Case: REAL-TIME-ANALYTICSid: REAL-TIME-ANALYTICStype: featuretitle: Real-Time Analytics Platformpurpose: Build real-time analytics and business intelligence platformstatus: DRAFTstate: -created: 2026-08-27updated: 2026-08-27depends_on:  - PAYMENT-INTEGRATIONproduces:  - backend/analytics-service  - backend/ingestion-service  - frontend/analytics-dashboard  - infrastructure/kafka  - infrastructure/clickhouse  - tests/loadchain: featuretemplate: modular-featurestages:  AN: -  AR: -  DB: -  BE: -  API: -  FE: -  MD: -  QA: -  DO: -  VR: -tech_stack:  languages:    - rust (L4 web-systems)    - typescript (L3-L4 enterprise)    - python (L3-L5 data-engineering)  frameworks:    - axum (rust web)    - nextjs (L1 dashboard)    - fastapi (L1 data api)  databases:    - postgresql (L3-L4 enterprise)    - redis (L1 caching)    - elasticsearch (L1 search)    - clickhouse (time-series)  platforms:    - docker (L3 kubernetes)    - kubernetes (L1-L2)    - terraform (L1)    - gcp (L1 cloud)  messaging:    - kafka (L1-L2 event streaming)    - nats (L1 lightweight)  cross-cutting:    - testing: performance, integration    - security: authentication, authorization    - architecture: event-driven, microservices    - observability: logging, metrics, tracing, alertingrules:  [A1] Data ingestion MUST handle 1M events/second.  [A2] Dashboard MUST refresh in real-time.  [A3] All queries MUST be optimized for time-series.  [A4] Data retention MUST be configurable.  [A5] Access MUST be role-based.  [A6] All pipelines MUST be idempotent.  [A7] Alerting MUST be configurable per metric.  [A8] Export MUST support multiple formats.decisions:  - id: RTA-001    title: Analytics engine selection    status: pending    options:      - clickhouse      - druid      - timescaledb  - id: RTA-002    title: Real-time transport    status: pending    options:      - websockets      - server-sent events      - pollingapproval_required:  - RTA-001  - RTA-002provisioning:  triggers:    - kafka cluster    - clickhouse cluster    - elasticsearch cluster    - redis cluster   State: -State: +